    <!-- Guide dialog -->
    <string name="guide_title">HoloCube Guide</string>
    <string name="guide_text">Start Inference: run transmitter recognition on live camera frames. At most one box labelled Transmitter with its confidence percentage is drawn: the strongest valid detection above the threshold.\n\nRecord: save a training video (MP4 with microphone audio) to Movies/HoloCube. Tap Stop to finish.\n\nTransmitter: show the HoloCube optical pattern full screen in landscape at maximum brightness, keeping the display awake. Tap the pattern for About Us; swipe from a screen edge to return.\n\n+ / −: zoom. ↺: switch camera. C: clear results and restart the camera.\n\nSettings: confidence threshold and PyTorch CPU threads.\n\nThe trained holocube_transmitter.pt checkpoint runs on this phone with embedded Python and PyTorch. No server or model download is needed.</string>
